  <item>
    <title>04 聊聊日本的女性摄影师｜怎么看照片 ｜摄影师推荐 ｜打破主流叙事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/679cc099247d51713c0b934b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">679cc099247d51713c0b934b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 12:29:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>日本摄影一直是国内很关注的一个话题，日本摄影专业没有大半，也有三分之一是我们国人的身影。日本摄影的盛况少不了女性摄影师的身影，她们在摄影艺术创作上取得了特别熠熠生辉的成就。</span><strong><span>在东亚的文化背景下，这绝非易事。</span></strong></p><p><span>这期聊聊「我眼中的日本女性摄影师」「怎么看照片」「为什么非主流视角这么重要」「为什么说我们需要更多艺术公共教育」等话题，希望让你看见更多的世界。</span></p><p><span>播客中提及的摄影师，包括</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DSsYWuNa1lhUJQw2an8THw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DSsYWuNa1lhUJQw2an8THw"><span>川内伦子</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IaaIL_d4G1Bcnfo-20eq6A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IaaIL_d4G1Bcnfo-20eq6A"><span>蜷川实花</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vbnD-NJJyTiUHzEh7E5hCw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vbnD-NJJyTiUHzEh7E5hCw"><span>石内都</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/L-23QVngsYKy2EhCOx4Dow" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/L-23QVngsYKy2EhCOx4Dow"><span>菊地智子</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yQAgsO1ISfOXXzv6VYgPqw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yQAgsO1ISfOXXzv6VYgPqw"><span>长岛有里枝</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><span>楢橋朝子</span><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GSo_0SQ8d530EuI2az9jgw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GSo_0SQ8d530EuI2az9jgw"><span>梅佳代</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Ih8ifbUP-qlRpsVonQt58A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Ih8ifbUP-qlRpsVonQt58A"><span>泽田知子</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/m6N0r7LBJd9y8hFZbMO1ug" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/m6N0r7LBJd9y8hFZbMO1ug"><span>片山真理</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/urhhfUImYAqkLS2Es69QzQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/urhhfUImYAqkLS2Es69QzQ"><span>今道子</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lsta-Ilt-dpaoHceU2OqTw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/lsta-Ilt-dpaoHceU2OqTw"><span>原美樹子</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h9CdF-syE8WCIuldoT6qow" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h9CdF-syE8WCIuldoT6qow"><span>HIROMIX</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jfwHPNOrOYBYlxLVq2HEJw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jfwHPNOrOYBYlxLVq2HEJw"><span>下薗詠子</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GsXijgka_x0BiuXfv_v7_w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GsXijgka_x0BiuXfv_v7_w"><span>藤冈亚弥</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><a href="https://www.pixyliao.com/" data-url="https://www.pixyliao.com/"><span>廖逸君</span></a><strong><span>、</span></strong><span>黛安·阿勃丝、南·戈尔丁、荒木经惟、深濑昌久等。</span></p><p><strong><em><span>戳我传送👇</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> 为什么要研究日本女性摄影师及研究方法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">07:29</a> 看照片的一种主观而又简单的方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a> 「妈妈 泰特美术馆教我怎么看懂当代艺术」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 菊地智子：勇闯异国，记录中国年轻性少数群体</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmFOZ2aQbJ7m5SqLTtbgEUnmoLHm.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 石内都：如织物般柔弱的质感，日本女性摄影的先驱者</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMoXJkKscQIb6ntKBnPrdHhkqm1.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> 川内伦子/原美树子：从照片看到生活和情绪</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FicTZkFju2bWM5yKAGFnFYFX73bc.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ForHtALzVbsh8ZwCYfzIAxfYw9d5.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 今道子：有血有肉的黑白视觉艺术</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3dM9T5C1ptVkW-YHQlDXOibJv2.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a> 楢桥朝子：惬意又惊现的水中风景</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 蜷川实花：用愉快的色彩冲破一切</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk6U0Rfigm_7p8xreFQyJKmZjSU2.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> 梅佳代：27岁的摄影师与她93岁的爷爷</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgLg7EwUgLAiZ-JcGQhuDzZOa9_P.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 长岛有里枝：打破权力关系框架、女性视角拍摄的亲密关系真实写照</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnR1qPj5pgAoX2W4aB4oyWeAS3Di.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2202">36:42</a> HIROMIX/下薗詠子：游走在时尚潮流前沿的肖像摄影</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoHfgumGWeY9liQrkyGZq481no9-.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCfjo2T3GfXanniXMD4fpdYpYyU.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 泽田知子：探索关于「我」的可能性与边界</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq8qGs1QtZ0O5wvwFmTnWQCCNBj5.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 片山真理：直面嘲笑，接纳真实的、完整的自己</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjcHhmTK9_m5kaSMC230BRoDco8z.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2506">41:46</a> </span><strong><span>为什么非主流视角这么重要</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> 黑灯：盲人脱口秀演员，为宣传罕见病「青少年黄斑变性」而站上舞台</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">43:03</a> 其实这个地球上有一半以上的人口都是「非主流人群」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2627">43:47</a> 为什么很多女性摄影师选择自拍？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2741">45:41</a> </span><strong><span>为什么我们需要更多艺术公共教育</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">48:15</a> 公众号评论区的三种「恶评」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3072">51:12</a> 藤冈亚弥：怀着对这片土地的眷恋、根系广岛</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgyKQU9grYX81YkAapw_Tqwz5tHN.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3297">54:57</a> 看作品，就是看见自己</span></p><p><strong><em><span>木村伊兵卫摄影奖系列👇 （欢迎follow我的公众号@木知Muki）</span></em></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi9wvaRuOskyV9SHsHuhuilIlSku.jpg"></figure><p><span>「木村伊兵卫摄影奖」这个系列暂时更完了～现在在研究中国女性摄影，发现在资料整理上特别困难，大家如果有合适的书籍/文献/资料，欢迎分享给我😊</span></p><p><strong><em><span>写在最后👇</span></em></strong></p><p><span>主播 @muki｜公众号/小红书@女性影像档案｜不务正业的日语生，搞摄影、设计和女性主义｜</span></p><p><span>BGM @Campagna - My Whole Life ｜@ES_Lemon Squeezy - Martin Landstrom</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66d415ec060e57ae019e2465/llIy2Jba0UX6MYFNLw9bebV36q6z.m4a" length="81415765" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:05</itunes:duration>
